{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31586","headline":"长沙紫极宫雨夜愁坐 · 李羣玉","name":"长沙紫极宫雨夜愁坐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独坐高斋寒拥衾，洞宫台殿窅沈沈。\n春灯含思静相伴，夜雨滴愁更向深。\n穷达未知他日事，是非皆到此时心。\n羁栖摧剪平生志，抱膝时爲梁甫吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}